    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">In this lecture Shaykh Khalid Yasin applies the analogy of the governmental body to the human being. From its conception it is insignifcant without power or sovereignity, but as it acquires power and develops it becomes robust and arrogant. However as time passes over, the body deteriorates and collapses, such is the similitude of the Human being</marc:subfield>
